            "trait_name": {
              "value": "Blinding Mud"
            },
            "trait_description": {
              "value": "When a muckish creep hits a creature with a mud ball Strike, that creature becomes dazzled (or blinded on a critical hit)\n\nThe creature can use an Interact action to wipe away the mud and remove the dazzled or blinded condition."
